# Project Documentation Phase

## Project Name

EduGenie – Google Gemini Powered Learning Assistant

## Project Overview

EduGenie is a Generative AI powered educational assistant that provides students with multiple learning services.

## Main Features

- Question and Answer
- Concept Explanation
- Quiz Generation
- Text Summarization
- Personalized Learning Recommendations

## Technologies Used

- Python
- FastAPI
- Google Gemini API
- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Jinja2
- Pydantic

